@startuml
title GitForge V1.0.0 - Commit History Activity
start
:Receive commit-history request;
:Resolve repository;
:Authorize read;
if (Authorized?) then (yes)
    :Resolve requested reference;
    if (Reference exists?) then (yes)
        :Read reachable commit history;
        :Return commit summaries;
    else (no)
        :Return safe reference-not-found result;
    endif
else (no)
    :Deny;
endif
stop
@enduml
